      "text": "The function \\( g \\) has derivatives of all orders, and its values at \\( x = 3 \\) are \\( g(3) = 4 \\), \\( g'(3) = -2 \\), \\( g''(3) = -1 \\), \\( g'''(3) = 6 \\). Find the second-degree Taylor polynomial for \\( g \\) about \\( x = 3 \\)."
