         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "Attach \\( (x - 3)^{k} \\) to the coefficient of order \\( k \\): \\( P(x) = 4 - 2(x - 3) - \\frac{1}{2}(x - 3)^{2} \\).",
